\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Remark}
\title{The cycle has not been read off}
\date{2026-11-06}

\p{The sum in \ref{fdip-00CQ} holds at every positive time. A
window that keeps each factor near a constant keeps the
product near the sum of those constants. The one-edge graph
of \ref{fdip-00CP} has spectral dimension falling to #{0}
for large time, so a positive height is a property of a
sequence of graphs.}
